#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn about activity tracking events for IBM Quantum System Service."
msgstr "Aprende sobre los eventos de seguimiento de actividad para IBM Quantum System Service."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activity tracking events for IBM Quantum System Service"
msgstr "Eventos de seguimiento de actividad para IBM Quantum System Service"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activity tracking events for IBM Quantum System Service {#activity-tracking-events-for-ibm-quantum-system-service}"
msgstr "Eventos de seguimiento de actividad para IBM Quantum System Service {#activity-tracking-events-for-ibm-quantum-system-service}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Cloud&reg; services, such as IBM Quantum&reg; System Service, generate activity tracking events.\n"
msgstr "Los servicios de IBM Cloud&reg;, como IBM Quantum&reg; System Service, generan eventos de seguimiento de actividad.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activity tracking events report on activities that change the state of a service in IBM Cloud. You can use the events to investigate abnormal activity and critical actions and to comply with regulatory audit requirements.\n"
msgstr "Los eventos de seguimiento de actividad informan sobre las actividades que cambian el estado de un servicio en IBM Cloud. Puedes usar los eventos para investigar actividades anómalas y acciones críticas, y para cumplir con los requisitos de auditoría regulatoria.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing, a platform service, to route auditing events in your account to destinations of your choice by configuring targets and routes that define where activity tracking events are sent. For more information, see [About IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Events Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/atracker?topic=atracker-about).\n"
msgstr "Puedes usar IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing, un servicio de plataforma, para enrutar eventos de auditoría en tu cuenta hacia los destinos que elijas configurando destinos y rutas que definen hacia dónde se envían los eventos de seguimiento de actividad. Para más información, consulta [About IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Events Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/atracker?topic=atracker-about).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use IBM Cloud Logs to visualize and alert on events that are generated in your account and routed by IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing to an IBM Cloud Logs instance.\n"
msgstr "Puedes usar IBM Cloud Logs para visualizar y generar alertas sobre eventos generados en tu cuenta y enrutados por IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing hacia una instancia de IBM Cloud Logs.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Viewing activity tracking events for IBM Quantum System Service {#viewing-activity-tracking-events-for-ibm-quantum-system-service}"
msgstr "Ver eventos de seguimiento de actividad para IBM Quantum System Service {#viewing-activity-tracking-events-for-ibm-quantum-system-service}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Launching IBM Cloud Logs from the Observability page {#launching-ibm-cloud-logs-from-the-observability-page}"
msgstr "Iniciar IBM Cloud Logs desde la página de Observabilidad {#launching-ibm-cloud-logs-from-the-observability-page}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For information on launching the IBM Cloud Logs UI, see the [Launching the UI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch#instance-launch-cloud-ui) in the IBM Cloud Logs documentation.\n"
msgstr "Para obtener información sobre cómo iniciar la interfaz de usuario de IBM Cloud Logs, consulta [Launching the UI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch#instance-launch-cloud-ui) en la documentación de IBM Cloud Logs.\n"

